{"product_id":"school-ship-tobermory-the-school-ship-tobermory-series","title":"School Ship Tobermory (The School Ship Tobermory Series)","description":"\u003cp\u003eFollow the exploits of the children who go to a most unusual school - the sail-powered training ship Tobermory. When a film crew arrives in Tobermory Bay, Ben and Fee are invited to be extras. But their suspicions are soon aroused - is the film crew genuine, or are they up to something sinister? Ben and Fee soon discover the truth when they uncover a dastardly plan masterminded by a South American businessman.\u003cbr\u003e\nDimensions: 195 x 130\u003cbr\u003e\nAuthor: Smith\u003cbr\u003e\nISBN: 9781780273433\u003cbr\u003e\nFormat: Paperback\u003cbr\u003e\nPages: 224\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"bookhero.ae","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":45872023830681,"sku":"13RA9781780273433","price":10.0,"currency_code":"AED","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/690f45286e496_School_Ship_Tobermory__The_School_Ship_Tobermory_Series.jpg?v=1762614441","url":"https:\/\/bookhero.ae\/products\/school-ship-tobermory-the-school-ship-tobermory-series","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - BookHero","version":"1.0","type":"link"}